<p>Pope Leo XIV used a special prayer vigil at St Peter’s Basilica on Saturday to urge political leaders to reject war and choose negotiation, delivering his strongest condemnation yet of the U.S.-Israeli war in Iran. He denounced what he called the “madness of war” and a “delusion of omnipotence,” and he also criticized the use of religious language to justify violence. His appeal came the same day senior U.S. and Iranian officials began face-to-face talks in Pakistan aimed at ending the six-week conflict, as reports said a fragile ceasefire was holding. That timing gave his message extra weight, pairing a sharp moral warning with a small but real diplomatic opening for de-escalation.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/MYowjTp3nk0VIrfc-Q_594dDMqA9JPgeNwXTDFEBwoDustZxlneTIMUnctWRYStSEHnEXPZOHW8SQTP_o9B1zN9JbKuqgBhRpsuLXnQItcwzwJWXqKzMD8_XLxQb27tF-ZFc0fnuRvUQ8reu25R0ldgvMwmmmoHV5zYvdVwhUbcYt_zCf9fj9nkJuPQrg19qJtFOWFIFMwz1jrMHawSADv_abQ' alt='Pope Leo XIV speaks during the April 11 prayer vigil at St Peter’s Basilica.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Global appeal: Leo framed the vigil as a call for billions of people around the world to embrace peace and “believe once again in love, moderation and good politics”.</li><li>Sharper tone: NPR said the Chicago-born pope had initially limited himself to more muted appeals for dialogue in the war’s early weeks before stepping up his criticism starting on Palm Sunday.</li><li>No names used: Several reports noted that Leo did not explicitly mention the United States or President Trump in the prayer, even as outlets read the remarks as criticism of the current war policy.</li></ul><blockquote>Enough with war! - Pope Leo XIV</blockquote><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/11/pope-leo-urges-world-leaders-to-reject-war-and-negotiate-peace'>Pope Leo urges world leaders to reject war and negotiate peace</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/pope-leo-urges-end-to-madness-of-war-as-us-iran-start-talks'>Pope Leo urges end to ‘madness of war’ as US, Iran start talks</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/pope-leo-xiv-blasts-delusion-omnipotence-fueling-us-131953097'>Pope Leo XIV blasts &#x27;delusion of omnipotence&#x27; fueling US-Israeli war in Iran</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/04/pope-leo-urges-end-madness-war-us-iran-start-talks'>Pope Leo urges end to &#x27;madness of war&#x27; as US, Iran start talks</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3349769/pope-leo-slams-delusion-omnipotence-stoking-us-israeli-war-iran'>Pope Leo slams ‘delusion of omnipotence’ stoking US-Israeli war on Iran</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.npr.org/2026/04/11/g-s1-117150/pope-leo-us-iran-war-israel-denounce'>Pope Leo says &#x27;delusion of omnipotence&#x27; is fueling U.S.-Israeli war in Iran</a> - npr.org</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/pope-leo-offers-latest-rebuke-iran-war/'>Pope Leo issues latest rebuke of Iran conflict: &quot;Enough with war!&quot;</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.pbs.org/newshour/world/pope-leo-xiv-denounces-the-delusion-of-omnipotence-he-says-is-fueling-the-u-s-israeli-war-in-iran'>Pope Leo XIV denounces the &#x27;delusion of omnipotence&#x27; he says is fueling the U.S.-Israeli war in Iran</a> - pbs.org</li></ul>